#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 301
#: rc.cpp:62
msgid ""
"This is the command which is executed when switching to the selected layout. "
"It may help you if you want to debug layout switching, or if you want to "
"switch layouts without the help of KDE."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die opdrag wat uitgevoer word wanneer gewissel word na die "
"verkose uitleg. Dit mag jou help as jy die uitleg wisseling wil ontfout, of "
"as jy uitlegte wil wissel sonder die hulp van KDE."

